diff --git a/.changeset/1git-diff-scroll.md b/.changeset/1git-diff-scroll.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/1git-diff-scroll.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+"@gpuix/native": patch
+---
+
+Expose the native diff list through existing pixel-scroll controls and honor a
+zero-height file header for application-owned chrome. Uses existing GPUI
+ListState APIs; no GPUI fork change is needed. Local 1git patch, not a release.
